Claude Commander x ZCode Executor Kit

This kit runs third-party software that it downloads at install time; it does not bundle that software:
- coder-mcp-bridge (https://github.com/Deslord319/coder-mcp-bridge), MIT License.
  Cloned by scripts/install.ps1 into ~/.zcode-commander/coder-mcp-bridge.

Portions of scripts/bridge_compat.py (account-provider snapshot, provider runtime
headers, provider-table environment handling) are a Python port of logic from:
- zcode-acp (https://github.com/william0wang/zcode-acp), Apache License 2.0.
  Source files: src/config/account-provider.ts, src/handlers/server-requests.ts
  (answerProviderRuntimeHeaders), src/backend/resolve.ts.
  A copy of the Apache License 2.0 is available at https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

